# Reason: never write into the game folder and never read game/cache. Compiled .rpyc, the bytecode
# cache and all other cache/ files go to config.player_cache_dir. The player cache is read first, then
# the game's own .rpyc (only when its source digest matches). renpy/common sources are read through
# renpy.vfs (virtual renpy_base). Also drops renpy_base/lock.txt.

